+      "severity": "HIGH",
+      "claim": "The Steadicam was invented by Garrett Brown in 1975",
+      "truth": "Garrett Brown created the Steadicam; the specification dates its first introduction to 1975. Its feature-film debut was Bound for Glory (1976).",
+      "evidence": "Eduqas specification, Appendix B; Tiffen History of Steadicam; American Cinematographer",
+      "verdict": "FIX"
+    },
