+      "truth": "Options: remove the prediction while keeping the accurate distinction, or retain it only with verified current-assessment evidence. The specification identifies Avengers: Infinity War but does not promise this distinction as a question.",
+      "evidence": "Eduqas assessment section and Appendix B",
